I found no Slovenian private app for the Evidenca o opremi or for preparing the ARSO report (searched in Slovenian and English). What exists:
- the free state REMIS/REMIS_TGP web forms;
- the official Word/paper form with filled-in examples on gov.si;
- Climalife's F-Gas Solutions app, which only calculates charge/GWP and leak-check frequency, is not a logbook and has no Slovenian;
- generic form tools such as the GoCanvas F-gas log sheet;
- an electronic logbook used in Slovakia (an IIR paper describes it; I did not confirm it is a commercial product).
Generic field-service/CMMS tools with refrigerant modules were not checked one by one.
